#   config/secrets/execution-testnet.env
#
# For LIVE/PAPER settings, use:
#   config/examples/execution-live-paper.env.example
# Copy it to:
#   config/secrets/execution-live-paper.env
#
# See docs/ENVIRONMENT_SETUP.md for every field and safe creation commands.
